"[INFO] [1741064110.676842111] [loaned_message_talker]: Publishing: "
"'2.000000'\n"
"[INFO] [1741064110.677008774] [loaned_message_talker]: Publishing: 'Hello "
"World: 2'\n"
"[INFO] [1741064111.676779850] [loaned_message_talker]: Publishing: "
